### Query AI Search - Default Top Value (Should use 10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": ["query with default top value"]
}

### Query AI Search - Vector Fields with Spaces (Should be trimmed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields=%20vector1%20,%20vector2%20,%20vector3%20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": ["test with spaces in vector fields"]
}


